<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-10-24T12:49:37.873Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 12:49:37 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Taliban forces opened fire on Pakistani security troops along the Kurram border, killing a Pakistani officer and several militants in Balochistan, while Pakistan halted trade at two Iran border crossings and a dispute over the Zangali checkpost is disrupting operations at the Torkham crossing as it advances a defence pact with Saudi Arabia and Turkey. The United Nations warns Afghanistan is one step away from famine and the Taliban opened a road to China that faces security hurdles. Iran halted LPG supplies, causing a shortage and price surge in Pakistan. 1,794 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168631&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE5mOWJpZDVCX1NJaXB0T1VBR0ZtdGtUZ2lma1NyVmJVekNVMGZXMVMwc2dHMVc5cjViZms0ajdkX3ByaElkQmo2NQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE9WU0ZHbEJfcnVqMms2Z1pjdjV5YVI0OVVfbE9leU4xVkViSk9wYzdkN040WFRWa1FsQXRHUXpUYVZyLWNYRUZEcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxOUHF5ekRkcndKaWc3dm5QbUlkS1NoR2VBZHlDcldxRTZZdVZyMFJmeHE2OGVfQlNYZFYwNUlHOGRwSnpKeGVzNVVCVjA1NEhaTXdXV01ZQ0FoSi1mbkNIeVd6RzNWSG5lTGx6Vk03MWd5bDIwOEQwejJSZ1c0YmtZaS1VVGdGM25IMWRhX1lEQUlVbERnYnpvaDFGOXVwZGt1NDRYSzRn?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE5BVzNFejVSUGNNdUpuZTF3ZjlJR1VLakZzZlY5QWlocFR6VUFkY25XTzRNV3lkd1BCSHFuWElTUE1sUnVldHdpdFVucExPeXJmcVAxdWQyWlhpdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nepali Patro&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https: